          <table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p text:style-name="P">(3) 인지경로</text:p></table:table-cell>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="PlainCell" table:number-columns-spanned="3"><text:p text:style-name="P">□언론보도 □인터넷(블로그, 카페 등) □ SNS □보건소, 의료기관 등 □지인 권유</text:p><text:p text:style-name="P">□기타(                                              )</text:p></table:table-cell>
